OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy but
OL,6,Fdry through the evening. Remaining
OL,7,Fcloudy through the night for much of
OL,8,Fthe region but clearer spells may
OL,9,Fdevelop at times. Mild overnight with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FWidely cloudy to start the
OL,13,Fday but dry for most places. Cloud
OL,14,Fbreaking to give sunny spells at
OL,15,Ftimes, particularly through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Feeling warm in the sun.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
